    content: "It sailed through waves like mountains, and Nuh called to his son, who stood apart: come aboard with us. The son answered that a mountain would protect him. Nuh said there was no protector that day from Allah's decree except for whom He showed mercy - and the wave came between them. Then the earth was told to swallow its water and the sky to withhold, and the ship rested on Judi.",
